``` CL-06 | Cluster Bundle Push Failed or Partially Applied
    Interpretation and RCA: Splunk Administrator Field Manual (Gaurav Malik),
    entry CL-06. https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HRXCT384

    Run on: SH for the error timeline, CM for the per-peer sync state.
    Query: Per-peer bundle sync state (CM)
    If this returns nothing, run probes/CL-06-probe.spl,
    probes/CL-06-probe-rest.spl to confirm the data it reads exists here.
```
| rest splunk_server=local /services/cluster/master/peers
| eval bundle_in_sync=if(active_bundle_id==latest_bundle_id,"yes","NO")
| table label site status active_bundle_id latest_bundle_id bundle_in_sync
| sort bundle_in_sync label
